Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add organizer role with its own events area

Organizers log in to /organizer/events and manage only the events they own. The organizer controller extends the admin one, swapping the route prefix and the event lookup (currentUser()->events()). The populate gets organizador@example.com, owner of two events.
